          "quote": "# GDT814 exploratory design and timing record\n\nThis required repository document is assembled after the exploratory pass.\nThere is no claimed blind confirmation, held score or prior semantic threshold.\nThe initial design is in src/DESIGN.md; the paragraph-boundary correction is\nexplicitly subsequent to inspecting the first extraction's incomplete blocks.\n\nBefore expanded paragraph application, the linguistic agent specified\nQ=warm? and R=anaphoric possessive dessen?, excluding action, hidden degree,\npartitive davon and origin daraus. GDT813 N/G and the shared seven guesses\nwere already known and remain unchanged. Known exact loci motivated this\ncomparison; historical sources and manual visual feedback informed synthesis.",
          "sha256": "fff11beebd4c4843b347062fa30ae706aaae45437e9273044e53ce28b5ea8b97"
